  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced.\n• Cut sweet potato into small chunks.\n• Place sweet potato on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with garlic & herb seasoning and season with salt. Toss to coat.\n• Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the sweet potato between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a1c467a4f34c14b7e3c5-fda24009.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Thinly slice brown onion.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Slice cucumber into thin sticks.\n• Thinly slice tomato into half-moons.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a1c467a4f34c14b7e3c5-d15399be.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium heat.\n• Cook onion, stirring, until softened, 5-6 minutes.\n• Add the balsamic vinegar, brown sugar and a splash of water. Mix well. Cook until dark and sticky, 3-5 minutes.\n• Transfer to a small bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a1c467a4f34c14b7e3c5-57ebd97d.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry.\n• Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• Wash and dry the frying pan, then return to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• When oil is hot, cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a1c467a4f34c14b7e3c5-049a010f.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In the last minute of cook time, add garlic to the pan and cook until fragrant, turning haloumi to coat.\n• Meanwhile, microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a1c467a4f34c14b7e3c5-418575b9.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread some garlic aioli over the base of each tortilla. Top with mixed salad leaves, sweet potato, cucumber, tomato, caramelised onion and garlic haloumi.\n• Drizzle with remaining aioli to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67a9a1c467a4f34c14b7e3c5-3a6007ec.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
